---
title: Posh Beans on Toast
author: Jonathan Simmonds
image: ./brunch/posh-beans-on-toast.jpg
servings: 1
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 10 minutes
---

Mix @egg{1} and @milk{30%ml} and soak @bread{2%slice} in this for about ~{3%minutes} per side.

Fry both sides of the bread on high.

Mix @avocado{0.5} and @mayo{} together and spread on the toast.

Microwave @borlotti beans{80%g} on low for about ~{3%minutes} and add to the toast.

> Optionally add @tomatoes{} or @wilted spinach{}.
